        {
          "t": "questStarted"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Ceril Carnillean.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "So, you want me to turn Philipe into an adventurer."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "How do you expect me to create a quest?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Where can I find all that stuff?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I'll come back later."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Search the bookcase in the room with Henryeta Carnillean for a book about the Carnillean family.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Butler Crichton.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Sir Ceril says you'll help me create a quest."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Yes, let's go."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationText",
          "text": ""
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Head into the basement and enter the hole on the east wall (cutscene will begin), then head back to the house.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Master bedroom",
      "text": "Go to the 1st floor[UK]2nd floor[US] and take the red and black dragon head from the wall (2 heads in total).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Open and search the southern wardrobe for the armour and sword.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Tear the net curtain from the north-east wall.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Take the money pouch from the bed or Henryeta's necklace from the dresser.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Philipe's room",
      "text": "<i>Search</i> his painting set for red paint.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Sarsaparilla's room",
      "text": "Talk to Sarsaparilla. , then talk again.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I'm creating a quest for Philipe. Will you help?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Are you just going to stay in here?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "You were talking about your ambitions."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I'm directing a drama. Would you like a part?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Damsel in distress"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Yes, follow me."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Open and search the wardrobe for her dress.",
      "actions": [
